''[[Huntik: Secrets & Seekers]]'' had previously made its official debut on the platform on the 6th February 2009, under the channel name ''[https://www.youtube.com/@HuntikGuggenheim HuntikGuggenheim]''. The channel, launched by [[Upper Deck]], was designed to tie in with the [[Huntik Trading Card Game]] and consisted of a number of exclusive videos named ''Dante's Huntik TCG Tips'' in which [[Dante Vale]] gives his advice on the best tactics for using different cards. The channel's final video was uploaded on 5th June 2009, called ''Huntik Store Championships: The Professor Recruits You!'' in which [[the Professor]] explains information of latest Huntik TCG competition.

A number of official videos including the ''[[Huntik TCG Tutorial]]'' and numerous toy adverts were uploaded on [[Upper Deck]]'s international YouTube channel in 2009. However, the channel was not solely dedicated to ''Huntik'' and featured videos from other properties as well. {{Source|Huntik TCG Tutorial}}

On 15th May 2012, an official channel was created for ''Huntik'' by Rainbow, named ''[https://www.youtube.com/@HuntikSecretsSeekers/ HuntikSecretsSeekers]''. However, the channel only featured one upload, the episode ''[[Knight of the Willblade]]'', which since been removed for unknown reasons. This was the last known official ''Huntik'' channel until October 2023 when Rainbow launched its brand new ''HuntikOfficial'' channel.
